  "description": "A lightweight messaging setup for .NET built on Wolverine and RabbitMQ. One call (AddGMMessaging) wires up the message bus with config-driven RabbitMQ connection, resilience (retry + circuit breaker) and producer/consumer topology, plus an outbox relay that retries with backoff, dead-letters, leases messages so it can run in several processes, cleans up old rows and continues traces. Part of the GM.Messaging family.",
